egin="00:21.990" end="00:22.740">mold </span><span begin="00:22.740" end="00:23.430">all </span><span begin="00:23.430" end="00:23.910">over </span><span begin="00:23.910" end="00:25.140">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.890" end="00:31.320"><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.130">The </span><span begin="00:26.130" end="00:26.700">room </span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:26.910">was </span><span begin="00:26.910" end="00:27.360">fit </span><span begin="00:27.360" end="00:27.540">for </span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:28.380">two</span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:31.320">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.320" end="00:35.220"><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:31.560">The </span><span begin="00:31.560" end="00:32.130">bed </span><span begin="00:32.130" end="00:32.370">was </span><span begin="00:32.370" end="00:32.910">left </span><span begin="00:32.910" end="00:33.030">in </span><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:35.220">ruins</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.750" end="00:40.740"><span begin="00:36.750" end="00:37.020">The </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.740">neighbor </span><span begin="00:37.740" end="00:38.010">was </span><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.790">knocking</span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:38.790">, </span><span begin="00:38.790" end="00:40.740">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.000" end="00:46.230"><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.360">But </span><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.930">no </span><span begin="00:42.930" end="00:43.200">one </span><span begin="00:43.200" end="00:43.440">would </span><span begin="00:43.440" end="00:43.950">let </span><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.220">him </span><span begin="00:44.220" end="00:46.230">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.230" end="00:50.040"><span begin="00:46.230" end="00:46.920">Touch </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.580">me</span><span begin="00:47.580" end="00:47.610">, </span><span begin="00:47.610" end="00:50.040">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.280" end="00:55.650"><span begin="00:50.280" end="00:50.550">I </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:51.090">want </span><span begin="00:51.090" end="00:51.420">you </span><span begin="00:51.420" end="00:51.630">to </span><span begin="00:51.630" end="00:52.350">touch </span><span begin="00:52.350" end="00:53.040">me </span><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:55.650">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.980" end="01:02.460"><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.430">Make </span><span begin="00:56.430" end="00:56.820">me </span><span begin="00:56.820" end="00:57.870">feel </span><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.530">like </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:59.220">I </span><span begin="00:59.220" end="00:59.910">am </span><span begin="00:59.910" end="01:02.460">breathing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.490" end="01:08.940"><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:03.300">Feel </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:04.020">like </span><span begin="01:04.020" end="01:04.680">I </span><span begin="01:04.680" end="01:05.280">am </span><span begin="01:05.280" end="01:08.940">human</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.690" end="01:13.380"><span begin="01:09.690" end="01:10.320">Dance </span><span begin="01:10.320" end="01:10.920">into </span><span begin="01:10.920" end="01:11.130">the </span><span begin="01:11.130" end="01:13.380">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.060" end="01:19.770"><span begin="01:15.060" end="01:15.210">A </span><span begin="01:15.210" end="01:15.930">vodka </span><span begin="01:15.930" end="01:16.410">and </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.530">a </span><span begin="01:16.530" end="01:19.770">sprite</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.520" end="01:24.210"><span begin="01:20.520" end="01:20.640">A </span><span begin="01:20.640" end="01:21.150">glimpse </span><span begin="01:21.150" end="01:21.420">of </span><span begin="01:21.420" end="01:21.570">the </span><span begin=